.git
.github
node_modules

# Secrets and local state — never copy these into an image.
#
# Every .env variant, not a hand-kept list. The list only named `.env` and
# `.env.local`, so `.env.prod` — the file holding the production database password,
# the Keycloak client secret and every API key — was copied straight into the image by
# `COPY . .`. Verified: a build context probe found /ctx/.env.prod inside the layer.
# Anyone who can pull the image can read them, and deleting the file later does not
# remove it from the layer history.
#
# The .example templates are re-admitted below: they carry no values and are useful
# documentation inside the container.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.prod.example

storage.json
storage.json.lock
.embeddings-cache.json
.usage-stats.json
.career-paths.json
*.log

# Not needed at runtime.
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.png
agent-skills/
SPRINT2.md
PATCH-pdf-fix.js
